{
  "_comment": [
    "The field names that cross between the Rust side and the window.",
    "Checked from both directions: a Rust test compares these against what the",
    "types actually serialise to, and a window test compares them against the",
    "stand-in backend its own tests run against. Without that the two suites",
    "can drift apart and both stay green -- the Rust tests never see the",
    "window, and the window tests never see the real Rust types.",
    "Changing a field name is meant to fail here first."
